.SH "نام (NAME)"
usbguard-dbus \- USBGuard D\-Bus interface service
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
usbguard\-dbus [OPTIONS]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The usbguard\-dbus component exposes a D\-Bus interface to a running instance of \fBusbguard\-daemon(8)\fR\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-s, \-\-system\fR
.RS 4
Listen on the system bus\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-S, \-\-session\fR
.RS 4
Listen on the session bus\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Show the help/usage screen\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
usbguard(1)
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.sp
If you find a bug in this software or if you\(cqd like to request a feature to be implemented, please file a ticket at https://github\&.com/USBGuard/usbguard/issues/new\&.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.sp
USBGuard was originally written by Daniel Kopeček\&. Many people have contributed to it\&.
.SH "RESOURCES"
.sp
Main web site: https://usbguard\&.github\&.io/
